WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.009 --> 00:00:16.729
Tom was worried.

2
00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:20.188
The princess was very sick.

3
00:00:20.189 --> 00:00:24.913
Everyone was waiting for news from the royal doctor.

4
00:00:24.914 --> 00:00:28.401
At last the doctor came into the Throne Room.

5
00:00:28.402 --> 00:00:31.552
"How is she?" cried the queen.

6
00:00:31.553 --> 00:00:35.291
"Will the princess be okay?" the king asked.

7
00:00:35.292 --> 00:00:36.703
The doctor nodded.

8
00:00:36.704 --> 00:00:40.872
"The princess can be cured."

9
00:00:40.873 --> 00:00:42.743
The queen touched her heart.

10
00:00:42.744 --> 00:00:45.605
"Oh, thank heavens!"

11
00:00:45.606 --> 00:00:48.532
"But . . . ," the doctor went on.

12
00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:52.573
"The princess must have something."

13
00:00:52.574 --> 00:00:56.921
"What?" Dirk snapped. "Anything!"

14
00:00:56.922 --> 00:00:58.378
"I'm afraid . . ."

15
00:00:58.379 --> 00:01:02.575
The doctor bowed his head.

16
00:01:02.576 --> 00:01:07.587
"The princess needs the juice of sweet pinkberries."

17
00:01:07.588 --> 00:01:12.317
The queen burst into tears.

18
00:01:12.318 --> 00:01:17.941
"But pinkberries only grow in the spring!"

19
00:01:17.942 --> 00:01:21.282
The king frowned.

20
00:01:21.283 --> 00:01:25.637
"We must be able to do something now!"

21
00:01:25.638 --> 00:01:29.400
"This is awful," Tom thought.

22
00:01:29.401 --> 00:01:32.045
Just then someone grabbed his arm.

23
00:01:32.046 --> 00:01:33.986
It was Dirk.

24
00:01:33.987 --> 00:01:38.052
He dragged Tom in front of the king and queen.

25
00:01:38.053 --> 00:01:42.317
"Our royal wizard can fix this!" said Dirk.

26
00:01:42.318 --> 00:01:45.444
"He can make a pinkberry bush appear!"

27
00:01:45.445 --> 00:01:48.820
"Er . . ." Tom gulped.

28
00:01:48.821 --> 00:01:51.349
"Sure, I can."

29
00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:58.942
Everyone cheered.

30
00:01:58.943 --> 00:02:08.125
The queen stopped crying.

31
00:02:08.126 --> 00:02:11.438
Everyone looked at Tom.

32
00:02:11.439 --> 00:02:16.430
But Tom just stood there.

33
00:02:16.431 --> 00:02:18.954
Dirk glared at Tom.

34
00:02:18.955 --> 00:02:21.656
"What are you waiting for?

35
00:02:21.657 --> 00:02:27.528
The princess needs pinkberries at once!"

36
00:02:27.529 --> 00:02:30.557
Tom's face was bright red.

37
00:02:30.558 --> 00:02:40.896
"I forgot my wand," he said.

38
00:02:40.897 --> 00:02:48.600
Everyone groaned.

